WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:03.536
-President Trump and one of
his closest allies in Congress

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:05.705
have spent the week
whining about people
who are mean to them.

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:08.474
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:08.474 --> 00:00:13.246
♪♪

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:15.648
One of the core themes
of Trump's campaign

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:16.883
was that he'd be tough.

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:18.818
He promised to return
to an era where people

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:20.786
weren't so sensitive
and politically correct,

00:00:20.786 --> 00:00:22.321
and he called
his opponents weak.

00:00:22.321 --> 00:00:25.925
In fact, there was one insult he
kept returning to over and over.

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:29.095
-We have a bunch of babies
running our country, folks.

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:33.333
We have a bunch of losers.
They're losers. They're babies.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:35.868
Oh, please. Please.
Don't be a baby, okay?

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:38.338
I know all these things.
I mean, I'm not a baby.

00:00:38.338 --> 00:00:40.439
I'm not saying I trust everybody
in the White House.

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:41.674
I'm not a baby.

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:43.509
Our companies
have been just taken

00:00:43.509 --> 00:00:44.977
like we're a bunch of babies.

00:00:44.977 --> 00:00:47.914
We're losing our jobs
like a bunch of babies.

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:50.983
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.983 --> 00:00:53.620
Babies don't have jobs.

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:58.090
Which means he has fired a baby.

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:01.027
"Take your crib and go."

00:01:01.027 --> 00:01:02.728
And, of course,
it's not just Trump.

00:01:02.728 --> 00:01:04.597
Right-wing pundits
on Fox News and elsewhere

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:06.398
have been lecturing progressives
for years

00:01:06.398 --> 00:01:09.068
not to be so sensitive
about stuff like, say, racism,

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:11.104
and they love
to use schoolyard disses

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:12.839
they think are really cool.

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:15.541
-America's left-wing
college professors

00:01:15.541 --> 00:01:17.476
and other snowflakes on campus.

00:01:17.476 --> 00:01:20.113
-Tonight, a quiz.
Are you a snowflake?

00:01:20.113 --> 00:01:23.516
-Actually, most of the
snowflakes work at CNN and NBC.

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:24.951
-I don't give a damn

00:01:24.951 --> 00:01:27.420
what the little snowflakes
think about anything.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:31.257
-We have a very special guest.
A therapy llama.

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:34.393
All these snowflakes in college,
they get so stressed out,

00:01:34.393 --> 00:01:36.729
you know,
they like to pet the llama,

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.697
and we're going to
show you guys that.

00:01:38.697 --> 00:01:40.767
-Oh! Oh, a therapy llama.

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.401
Maybe you can bring it
to the White House.

00:01:42.401 --> 00:01:44.871
It'll blend into
the President's hair.

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:47.005
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.005 --> 00:01:49.742
And yet -- And yet...

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:52.778
the guy who called
his opponents babies

00:01:52.778 --> 00:01:54.480
has spent his entire term
as president

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.215
whining about people
being mean to him,

00:01:56.215 --> 00:01:58.218
from "Saturday Night Live"
to John McCain to Google.

00:01:58.218 --> 00:02:00.520
In fact, this morning,
he once again lashed out

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:02.655
at George Conway, the husband
of one of his advisers,

00:02:02.655 --> 00:02:03.989
Kellyanne Conway.

00:02:03.989 --> 00:02:06.225
George Conway is a longtime
Republican lawyer in D.C.

00:02:06.225 --> 00:02:08.227
who has called Trump
mentally unfit for office.

00:02:08.227 --> 00:02:11.163
And as always, Trump
could not help but fire back.

00:02:11.163 --> 00:02:13.232
-He says this --
"George Conway,

00:02:13.232 --> 00:02:15.568
often referred to
as Mr. Kellyanne Conway

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:19.439
by those who know him, is very
jealous of his wife's success

00:02:19.439 --> 00:02:21.707
and angry that I, with her help,

00:02:21.707 --> 00:02:24.376
didn't give him the job
he so desperately wanted.

00:02:24.376 --> 00:02:27.046
I barely know him,
but just take a look.

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:30.282
A stone-cold loser
and husband from hell."

00:02:30.282 --> 00:02:32.184
-I'm sorry, but you are
the last person

00:02:32.184 --> 00:02:33.853
who should call anyone else
the husband from hell.

00:02:33.853 --> 00:02:36.755
You've been divorced twice, you
paid hush money to a porn star,

00:02:36.755 --> 00:02:38.724
your affairs
were all over the tabloids,

00:02:38.724 --> 00:02:40.860
and you misspelled
your wife's name.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:42.228
If anything...

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:44.397
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:44.397 --> 00:02:47.800
If anything, "Husband From Hell"
sounds like the name

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:50.536
of a Lifetime movie about you.

00:02:50.536 --> 00:02:53.072
And I hate to tell you,
but just like "SNL" did,

00:02:53.072 --> 00:02:56.475
they're gonna get Alec Baldwin.

00:02:56.475 --> 00:02:59.478
Trump can't let -- He can't let
go of even the pettiest feuds.

00:02:59.478 --> 00:03:01.748
For example, this week,
he repeatedly slammed

00:03:01.748 --> 00:03:03.949
the late senator and war hero
John McCain.

00:03:03.949 --> 00:03:05.751
Trump is still mad
that McCain voted against

00:03:05.751 --> 00:03:08.154
his healthcare bill
with that infamous thumbs-down,

00:03:08.154 --> 00:03:10.056
which I have to say
is an effective way to say no

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:11.557
to a pushy [bleep]
like Donald Trump.

00:03:11.557 --> 00:03:13.226
Based on every picture of Trump,

00:03:13.226 --> 00:03:16.996
he probably didn't even know
thumbs could even go that way.

00:03:16.996 --> 00:03:18.898
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.898 --> 00:03:21.567
"Where do I --
So I stand on my head?"

00:03:21.567 --> 00:03:24.170
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:26.505
Trump...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:26.505 --> 00:03:28.641
Trump has been attacking McCain

00:03:28.641 --> 00:03:30.876
in tweets and comments
to reporters all week,

00:03:30.876 --> 00:03:33.612
and then today he complained
that McCain didn't thank him

00:03:33.612 --> 00:03:36.248
for letting him have a funeral.

00:03:36.248 --> 00:03:39.018
-I endorsed him at his request.

00:03:39.018 --> 00:03:42.721
And I gave him the kind
of funeral that he wanted,

00:03:42.721 --> 00:03:45.791
which as president,
I had to approve.

00:03:45.791 --> 00:03:46.992
I don't care about this.

00:03:46.992 --> 00:03:49.795
I didn't get "thank you."
That's okay.

00:03:49.795 --> 00:03:52.865
-Because he was dead.
Man, you know...

00:03:52.865 --> 00:03:54.767
I don't know
if McCain's a ghost,

00:03:54.767 --> 00:03:57.937
but he's clearly haunting you.

00:03:57.937 --> 00:03:59.138
Trump's always been obsessed

00:03:59.138 --> 00:04:00.940
with even the smallest
perceived slights,

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.808
but lately
he and his fellow conservatives

00:04:02.808 --> 00:04:05.144
have turned their attention
to a new target -- the Internet.

00:04:05.144 --> 00:04:07.179
They think the Internet
is biased against them.

00:04:07.179 --> 00:04:09.248
In fact, Trump has become
obsessed with the idea

00:04:09.248 --> 00:04:11.651
that Google in particular
is rigged to make him look bad.

00:04:11.651 --> 00:04:13.486
-"Facebook, Google, and Twitter,

00:04:13.486 --> 00:04:15.321
not to mention
the corrupt media," he says,

00:04:15.321 --> 00:04:18.257
"are so on the side of
the radical-left Democrats."

00:04:18.257 --> 00:04:20.893
-"Google is helping China
and their military,

00:04:20.893 --> 00:04:22.095
but not the U.S.

00:04:22.095 --> 00:04:23.196
Terrible.

00:04:23.196 --> 00:04:24.497
The good news is

00:04:24.497 --> 00:04:26.332
they helped crooked
Hillary Clinton and not Trump.

00:04:26.332 --> 00:04:27.900
How did that turn out?"

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:29.669
-"Google search results
for 'Trump news'

00:04:29.669 --> 00:04:32.305
shows only the viewing reporting
of fake-news media.

00:04:32.305 --> 00:04:34.140
In other words,
they have it rigged."

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:36.342
-In fairness to Trump,
he probably thinks Google

00:04:36.342 --> 00:04:38.544
is biased against him
because if you search his name,

00:04:38.544 --> 00:04:40.112
all the results are bad.

00:04:40.112 --> 00:04:42.247
In fact, if you type
"Donald Trump" into Google,

00:04:42.247 --> 00:04:44.083
you just get an error message
that says,

00:04:44.083 --> 00:04:46.185
"Why are you doing this
to yourself?"

00:04:46.185 --> 00:04:48.387
And it isn't just
the news articles that are bad.

00:04:48.387 --> 00:04:50.623
Even the "people also
search for" tab is damning.

00:04:50.623 --> 00:04:51.891
Three of the top results are

00:04:51.891 --> 00:04:53.993
Michael Cohen, Robert Mueller,
and Barack Obama.

00:04:53.993 --> 00:04:56.162
Pretty easy to see
the thought process there.

00:04:56.162 --> 00:04:57.963
He committed crimes
with Michael Cohen

00:04:57.963 --> 00:05:00.999
and is being investigated
by Robert Mueller,

00:05:00.999 --> 00:05:03.903
and can we go back
to Barack Obama?

00:05:03.903 --> 00:05:05.371
Conservatives...

00:05:05.371 --> 00:05:08.307
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:08.307 --> 00:05:11.811
Conservatives have been whining
about media bias for decades.

00:05:11.811 --> 00:05:13.145
It is not sincere.

00:05:13.145 --> 00:05:14.447
They're just working the refs

00:05:14.447 --> 00:05:16.249
because they don't want
fair treatment --

00:05:16.249 --> 00:05:17.817
they want special treatment.

00:05:17.817 --> 00:05:20.452
And now they're doing the same
thing to social-media companies.

00:05:20.452 --> 00:05:22.788
And the dumbest example of that
came this week

00:05:22.788 --> 00:05:25.524
from California Republican
Congressman Devin Nunes.

00:05:25.524 --> 00:05:26.859
He's the guy who was in charge

00:05:26.859 --> 00:05:28.727
of the Russia investigation
in the House

00:05:28.727 --> 00:05:31.364
until he had to step down
because he was bad at his job.

00:05:31.364 --> 00:05:33.232
Remember him?
The guy who looks like

00:05:33.232 --> 00:05:37.870
when you open your phone and
the front-facing camera is on?

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:42.074
You know, Michael Scott,
but somehow dumber-looking?

00:05:42.074 --> 00:05:44.510
Like Trump,
Nunes has been whining

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:46.879
about social-media bias
against conservatives,

00:05:46.879 --> 00:05:48.780
but now he's going
one step further.

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:51.184
He's suing Twitter
for supposedly censoring him

00:05:51.184 --> 00:05:54.120
and for allowing fake Twitter
accounts to be mean to him.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:56.188
And he's suing
those fake accounts, too.

00:05:56.188 --> 00:05:58.491
Nunes, who is also
a dairy farmer,

00:05:58.491 --> 00:06:01.860
is suing two parody accounts
called -- and this is real --

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:05.231
Devin Nunes' Mom
and Devin Nunes' Cow.

00:06:05.231 --> 00:06:08.267
[ Laughter ]
That is right.

00:06:08.267 --> 00:06:12.972
Devin Nunes is suing a fake
account called Devin Nunes' Cow,

00:06:12.972 --> 00:06:16.442
and he's mad because
it got too many re-teats.

00:06:16.442 --> 00:06:18.444
[ Cow moos ]

00:06:18.444 --> 00:06:21.047
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:26.118 --> 00:06:27.419
[ Laughter ]

00:06:27.419 --> 00:06:29.021
The next card says,

00:06:29.021 --> 00:06:30.856
"Audience carries me out
on their shoulders,"

00:06:30.856 --> 00:06:32.658
but I don't think...

00:06:32.658 --> 00:06:34.861
We'll skip it.

00:06:34.861 --> 00:06:37.663
[ Laughter ]

00:06:37.663 --> 00:06:40.165
But that wasn't the dumbest part
of the lawsuit.

00:06:40.165 --> 00:06:43.202
The dumbest part was the fact
that in order to make his case,

00:06:43.202 --> 00:06:46.171
Nunes provided example tweets
from the fake accounts,

00:06:46.171 --> 00:06:47.473
tweets that until now

00:06:47.473 --> 00:06:49.141
most people
had never even seen before.

00:06:49.141 --> 00:06:50.876
For example, the account
Devin Nunes' Mom

00:06:50.876 --> 00:06:53.445
posted a graphic claiming
that Trump, Putin, and Nunes

00:06:53.445 --> 00:06:56.649
were attached to each other
like a human centipede.

00:06:56.649 --> 00:07:00.152
Nunes put that graphic
in his lawsuit.

00:07:00.152 --> 00:07:02.021
[ Laughter ]

00:07:02.021 --> 00:07:04.623
Dude! What is wrong with you?!

00:07:04.623 --> 00:07:08.327
Before you filed this lawsuit,
no one had ever seen that.

00:07:08.327 --> 00:07:09.995
It's like you passed out
at a party,

00:07:09.995 --> 00:07:11.864
and someone drew a dick
on your forehead,

00:07:11.864 --> 00:07:14.900
so you got mad and took a selfie
and put it on Instagram.

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:17.169
And to be clear -- to be clear,
we here at "Late Night"

00:07:17.169 --> 00:07:19.004
would never have made
a graphic like this,

00:07:19.004 --> 00:07:21.507
and we certainly would
never have been allowed
to show it on TV,

00:07:21.507 --> 00:07:23.475
but now it's part
of an official lawsuit

00:07:23.475 --> 00:07:26.678
by a member of Congress,
and we have to show it.

00:07:26.678 --> 00:07:28.814
In fact, and again --
Again, I hate --

00:07:28.814 --> 00:07:30.148
I hate that I had to do this.

00:07:30.148 --> 00:07:33.652
But legally, I had to have it
printed on a T-shirt.

00:07:33.652 --> 00:07:35.421
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:35.421 --> 00:07:37.356
There we go.

00:07:42.694 --> 00:07:45.797
We might even sell it
in the NBC Store

00:07:45.797 --> 00:07:49.234
in that secret room behind the
door that says "Weird [Bleep]."

00:07:49.234 --> 00:07:53.338
You know, where they keep the
anatomically correct Alf dolls.

00:07:53.338 --> 00:07:56.108
Just to give you an idea

00:07:56.108 --> 00:07:58.478
of how badly
this lawsuit has backfired,

00:07:58.478 --> 00:08:00.879
in the lawsuit,
Nunes' lawyers write

00:08:00.879 --> 00:08:02.514
that the account
Devin Nunes' Cow

00:08:02.514 --> 00:08:04.116
had 1,204 followers.

00:08:04.116 --> 00:08:05.951
Obviously,
that's a very small number.

00:08:05.951 --> 00:08:07.219
But as of this taping,

00:08:07.219 --> 00:08:09.087
because of the publicity
from the lawsuit,

00:08:09.087 --> 00:08:11.490
Devin Nunes' Cow had --
and, again, this is real --

00:08:11.490 --> 00:08:13.759
471,000 followers.

00:08:13.759 --> 00:08:15.794
[ Laughter ]

00:08:15.794 --> 00:08:17.263
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:17.263 --> 00:08:19.832
And, by the way, we've had to
change that number all day.

00:08:19.832 --> 00:08:21.734
When this airs
six hours from now,

00:08:21.734 --> 00:08:24.035
I'm sure it'll be like
a 1.5 million.

00:08:24.035 --> 00:08:26.571
In fact, the fake cow account
now has more followers

00:08:26.571 --> 00:08:30.342
than Devin Nunes' real account.

00:08:30.342 --> 00:08:36.182
Even Devin Nunes' actual cows
are following it now.

00:08:36.182 --> 00:08:37.450
So a Republican congressman

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.518
is suing people for being mean
to him on Twitter,

00:08:39.518 --> 00:08:42.020
and the President is
feuding with a senator
who is no longer alive.

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:46.325
There's nothing I can say to
make you guys feel better but...

00:08:46.325 --> 00:08:48.294
can I get you a free T-shirt?

00:08:48.294 --> 00:08:50.730
This has been "A Closer Look."

